,24,25,24,24,24,26,25,24,24,25,25],"nar":[{"lap":1,"text":"Hunt got the best start and led into the first corner from John Watson and Jacques Laffite, with Andretti dropping down to fourth.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":2},{"lap":5,"text":"However, Watson passed Hunt on the fifth lap and started to build a gap until Andretti got up to second and began to reel him in.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":1},{"lap":80,"text":"Northern Irishman John Watson led for most of the race in his Brabham-Alfa Romeo, before Andretti passed him on the final lap.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"During the final few laps, leader Watson and Andretti were running nose-to-tail but Watson held him off till the last lap when his 12 cylinder Alfa engine ran out of fuel and immediately Andretti was past.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}